{"id":"enquanto","lemma":"enquanto","pos":"conj","rank":201,"glosses":["as; while (at the same time as)","while; whereas (introduces a situation that is contrasts with another situation)"],"ipa":"/ẽˈkwɐ̃.tu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-enquanto.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-enquanto.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Enquanto isso, você deveria dormir um pouco.","en":"Meanwhile, you should get a little sleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1182709","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to sleep"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"slightly"]]},{"text":"Vamos manter isto entre nós por enquanto.","en":"Let's keep this between us for the time being.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844431","words":[{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to keep, maintain"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"among"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Eu quero ficar enquanto puder.","en":"I want to stay as long as I can.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to become"},null,{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"}]},{"text":"Estou seguro por enquanto.","en":"I'm safe for now.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"safe"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Por enquanto, é isso.","en":"That's it for now.","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"that"}]}]}